PRODUCT IDENTITY
----------------
This is "Open Grok", a Swift source-port of the Open Grok codebase. The public
executable is `open-grok`. Runtime and configuration state is isolated to
`$OPENGROK_HOME` or `~/.opengrok`; the legacy `~/.grok` path is never read or
written.

DERIVED SOURCE
--------------
This Swift port is derived from the Open Grok Rust codebase, which itself
incorporates derived behavior from:

  * Codex (OpenAI Codex) — Code Mode JavaScript cell runtime, compaction V2,
    provider protocol, and session compatibility contracts. NOTICE-pinned
    source revision: 2be648ba4a6c159a3d80b1c07e7323cbd5efef8f
    (https://github.com/openai/codex). The per-target NOTICE files (W1-S4,
    W6-S1) reproduce this pin verbatim, and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES retains the
    full derived-source provenance.
  * Ratatui — inline/fullscreen terminal behavior reimplemented in the custom
    OpenGrokTerminalCore/OpenGrokTextArea stack (W2-S5).
  * Mermaid, dagre_rust, graphlib_rust, ordered_hashmap, mermaid-to-svg —
    diagram parsing, layout, and SVG rendering (W8-S2). Includes mermaid.js /
    dagre.js / graphlib.js MIT-licensed ancestry.
  * Roboto font — Copyright 2011 Google Inc.; used by Mermaid SVG rendering
    (W8-S2) as a deterministic fallback face, redistributed under Apache-2.0.

The full per-package and transitive license inventory is generated and audited
by the W11-S5 release-validation slice and embedded in release artifacts and
the in-product notices view. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES for the bootstrap summary.
